{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_43", "source_id": "62162e3a000000002103bb8b", "title": "给混油皮安利一款无敌好用的伪素颜神器防晒", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62162e3a000000002103bb8b", "topic_family": "防晒", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 459, "evidence_unit_count": 14, "original_evidence_unit_count": 14, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 47, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 大家好 我是小森林 今天想给你们推荐一款我非常喜欢的防晒", "有四个档位 一档是最清爽 四档是最滋润 我这个是二档的 我一般就是买一二档", "或者是去健身房健身 但是这时候不想化妆 可是又想要自己的气色能够好一点", "我也很推荐一些上班族用这一支防晒 像平时早上上班通勤比较感", "就是这么白净 很心机的一款为素颜神器 天天给你们用", "有四个档位 一档是最清爽 四档是最滋润 我这个是二档的 我一般就是买一二档", "我最喜欢它一点 就是它的提料效果非常的好 有时候我们只是想下楼买个东西"], "retained_quotes": ["有四个档位 一档是最清爽 四档是最滋润 我这个是二档的 我一般就是买一二档", "我最喜欢它一点 就是它的提料效果非常的好 有时候我们只是想下楼买个东西"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62162e3a000000002103bb8b/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62162e3a000000002103bb8b/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62162e3a000000002103bb8b/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62162e3a000000002103bb8b/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "b9dafc51fd7f6a0b7dc7b3e3e6e2e5c5caa75688fe978cc948606a6c0e61a802", "card_hash": "419e9ebed09acadae57df3dee9582221e3650ffedb868043cb6416b1fc0a5cfa", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_43", "source_id": "620f1f7d00000000210366b5", "title": "真实有效去闭口、痘痘经验分享", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620f1f7d00000000210366b5", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1319, "evidence_unit_count": 37, "original_evidence_unit_count": 37, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 102, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天给你分享我的战斗经验 我曾经是一个豆皮长9年的豆豆", "这个方法比美容院什么海飞秀 大气泡小气泡都要好用 自从我用了这个方法之后", "皮肤非常的光滑健康 而且还变白了 姐妹们你们不要一上 一上来就整一个那种打打猛的酸类的精华", "那种红种大豆你就不长了跟你就没关系了 如果是喜欢莫名其妙长那种红种大豆的女生", "你们赶快试下来吧 记得来给我反馈哦", "那最后一点呢就是面霜一定要非常的清爽 不要再使用那些非常厚重的修复类的面霜涂在脸上了", "我是用了什么呢 那第一点就是深层清洁 我每周会做一到两次深层清洁"], "retained_quotes": ["那最后一点呢就是面霜一定要非常的清爽 不要再使用那些非常厚重的修复类的面霜涂在脸上了", "我是用了什么呢 那第一点就是深层清洁 我每周会做一到两次深层清洁"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620f1f7d00000000210366b5/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620f1f7d00000000210366b5/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620f1f7d00000000210366b5/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620f1f7d00000000210366b5/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "f3a80cecbda2a1818f36085d7950fbd9f3113eac10af8b08044206baf1215dff", "card_hash": "194976933022f3f67f1bf1e01c2403fe87a7b8ca95aa5b091fc398843389b9ab", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_43", "source_id": "620b3572000000000102e6e3", "title": "烂脸战“痘”成妈生皮", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620b3572000000000102e6e3", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 806, "evidence_unit_count": 19, "original_evidence_unit_count": 19, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["今年，是我战“痘”的第九个年头，我终于，战胜了它", "去看过很多次医生，医生觉得我只是长点青春痘，开一个痘痘药就把我打发了", "2019年，我接触了刷酸、早c晚a，一开始还真的很有效果，尝到了甜头，皮肤变的超级细腻，额头的粉刺也好了一些", "2022年，我终于可以说：我战痘成功了 现在额头非常平滑、平整", "#祛痘[话题]# #怎么才能去闭口[话题]# #油痘肌[话题]# #油痘肌大作战[话题]# #闭口粉刺[话题]# 2x", "偶尔皮肤有好转但是依然会复发 2018年，我来到广东，这边夏天很闷，很快我又长了一脸的痘，额头是闭口+大痘痘，脸颊是一个个硕大的痘痘", "这几年医美开始兴起，我也开始尝试，针清、焕肤、激光我都试了，做完都是有效果的，但是过几天，闭口又出来了，这种方法无法根除我的爆痘情况"], "retained_quotes": ["偶尔皮肤有好转但是依然会复发 2018年，我来到广东，这边夏天很闷，很快我又长了一脸的痘，额头是闭口+大痘痘，脸颊是一个个硕大的痘痘", "这几年医美开始兴起，我也开始尝试，针清、焕肤、激光我都试了，做完都是有效果的，但是过几天，闭口又出来了，这种方法无法根除我的爆痘情况"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620b3572000000000102e6e3/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620b3572000000000102e6e3/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620b3572000000000102e6e3/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_620b3572000000000102e6e3/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "93818ab8fff49bb93162a885abbbab97e56929068183b8b41decd462f997f0ba", "card_hash": "9426d