{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_43", "source_id": "615678770000000001024cfb", "title": "真的能淡化黑眼圈的眼霜", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_615678770000000001024cfb", "topic_family": "眼周护理", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 683, "evidence_unit_count": 20, "original_evidence_unit_count": 20, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我以前一直以为黑眼圈和泪沟只能靠别的方法解决了", "我才知道原来我买的这款是新款 还是含a醇的", "泪沟都淡了 （我之前是有一点点泪沟的，有泪沟的姐妹都懂遮瑕起来有多难", "一起变美 [赞R]（敏感肌mm还是要慎重）", "Rides et Taches 以前 现在", "这款用了几天后，我颧骨敏感泛红了，于是我就一直找原因，一开始以为是我给t区刷猛酸的时候不小心带到了颧骨引起了敏感（因为我颧骨那的肌肤薄，容易泛红）", "）眼下变的平整了 （我不明白为啥眼霜可以让我眼下泪沟变的平整，总之平整之后尽管还是有黑眼圈，但是比泪沟好遮多了）"], "retained_quotes": ["这款用了几天后，我颧骨敏感泛红了，于是我就一直找原因，一开始以为是我给t区刷猛酸的时候不小心带到了颧骨引起了敏感（因为我颧骨那的肌肤薄，容易泛红）", "）眼下变的平整了 （我不明白为啥眼霜可以让我眼下泪沟变的平整，总之平整之后尽管还是有黑眼圈，但是比泪沟好遮多了）"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_615678770000000001024cfb/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_615678770000000001024cfb/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_615678770000000001024cfb/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_615678770000000001024cfb/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "8e1697e91e81d760eb64ebdaccabd7aedb1220e1c0d97822a4379a640d705977", "card_hash": "75c349ecbbff1b9dec9ba6eaa886ae49d3ebbd8f170a47768bc9c24e77a2ae76", "callable": false, "status